parslinux-package-installer (3.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * AppImage portable package inspection, execution, and desktop menu integration
  * Flathub Flatpakref (.flatpakref) and Flatpakrepo (.flatpakrepo) installation support
  * Standalone portable automation scripts (run.sh, stop.sh, install.sh, uninstall.sh, package.sh, manage.sh)
  * High-resolution native GTK 4 & Libadwaita screenshots and updated visual assets
  * Zero remaining legacy Pardus imagery and clean multi-distro packaging

