parslinux-package-installer (2.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Flathub smart alternative recommendations and in-app installation banner
  * Universal RPM (.rpm) package format inspection and installation engine
  * Pure Python binary RPM lead and header metadata parsing without external C tools
  * Cross-distro package loading for Debian (.deb), Arch (.pkg.tar.*), and RPM (.rpm)
  * System snapshot safety (Timeshift, Snapper, Btrfs) and desktop notifications

 -- Pars Linux Developers <dev@parslinux.org>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 03:00:00 +0300

parslinux-package-installer (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Pars Linux Package Installer (parslinux-package-installer)
  - Pure GTK 4 and Libadwaita modern user interface
  - Universal package support: Debian (.deb) and Arch Linux (.pkg.tar.*)
  - Dual-backend transaction engine with APT and Pacman
  - Single-click install, reinstall, downgrade, and removal mechanism
  - Batch package installation queue with live progress
  - Headless CLI inspection modes (-i/--info, -c/--check)
  - Remote HTTP/HTTPS package download and inspection
  - Multiarch architecture validation and dependency checking
  - PolicyKit secure authentication

 -- Pars Linux Developers <dev@parslinux.org>  Tue, 13 Oct 2026 22:50:00 +0300
